            <titlePart>at the | End of the Rule you are directed how to find them. | </titlePart>
            <titlePart rend="smallcap">Calculations, </titlePart>
            <titlePart>directing with moral | Certainty, how to play well any Hand or Game,
                | by ſhewing the Chances of your Partner’s having | 1, 2, or 3 Certain
                Cards. | With variety of </titlePart>
            <titlePart rend="smallcap">Cases </titlePart>
